WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.384 --> 00:00:11.616
To mothers who have to stand as a wedding parent while dealing with hair loss from chemotherapy, the first thing we want to say is, "You have absolutely nothing to worry about."

2
00:00:11.952 --> 00:00:19.488
With a skilled artist's careful touch, you can be transformed into a natural, dignified wedding parent, with no sign that a wig is being used.

3
00:00:19.824 --> 00:00:24.600
The key to wedding-parent hair for chemotherapy patients lies in choosing the right full wig and styling it with precision.

4
00:00:24.936 --> 00:00:28.536
Since everyone's head size and shape are different,

5
00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:35.496
you can either bring a wig that's fitted to your own head, or use one available at the shop doing your wedding-parent hair.

6
00:00:35.832 --> 00:00:39.552
We recommend choosing human hair whenever possible.

7
00:00:39.888 --> 00:00:48.840
A human-hair wig can handle heat styling with an iron or dryer, giving it the natural shine and full volume of real hair.

8
00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:51.936
There are two main styling directions.

9
00:00:52.272 --> 00:00:58.560
If you want to bring out the soft beauty of the hanbok, an updo using a long full wig works well,

10
00:00:58.896 --> 00:01:04.752
and if you're after a more modern, polished look, we recommend a short cut or bob style with a shorter wig.

11
00:01:05.088 --> 00:01:14.616
An artist experienced with wigs will carefully blend the hairline so the edge doesn't look off, and add the right volume for a middle-aged face shape to finish beautifully.

12
00:01:14.952 --> 00:01:18.792
Above all, a one-on-one prior consultation is essential.

13
00:01:19.128 --> 00:01:28.488
Meeting an artist beforehand to check the wig's condition and try out the style that suits you best can turn wedding-day nerves into excitement and confidence.

14
00:01:28.824 --> 00:01:31.680
A well-prepared wedding parent is the most beautiful one.
